 "description": "Compute Lens compares measured workload runs using total entered compute, setup, storage and egress costs per accepted output. It filters mismatched workload labels, currencies, quality and memory limits. All examples are fictional; no live GPU quotes are supplied. No live GPU inventory, automatic benchmarking, reservation, infrastructure management or verified savings. Retrieve compute with fetch or read its example resource to obtain exact inputs. Parameters are processed remotely without application persistence.",
